      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLY BURRA (1) finished fourth last start over 2200m at Marburg, beaten 4.5 metres, after a modest sixth at this track the run prior. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Needs to be at his best to beat this field but he is up to the challenge. TOMMY BLIGH (10) ran ninth last start at this track over 1780m, beaten 12 metres. Capable of playing a major role so has to be respected. PERFECT FEELING (3) found form and finished in the money two runs ago then came back to earth when he broke and finished fourth last start over 2040m at this track, coming home 5 metres from the winner. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Finds a nice race and can make up for that last start mishap. THE HARRIS HAWK (6) is worth some thought after his last-start fourth over 1660m at Albion Park on July 23.",
